        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A living polymerisation process where a transfer agent AX, reacts reversibly with an initiating radical R. or a propagating radical R(M)[n]. to give another transfer agent RX or R(M)[n]X and a species capable of initiating polymerisation.</obo:IAO_0000115>
